        "id": "ch13_1_5-1",
        "text": "Encryption Basics\nEncryption is divided into two categories: symmetric and asymmetric. Symmetric\nencryption will use one key to encrypt and decrypt data. On the other hand,\nasymmetric encryption will use unique public and private keys to encrypt and\ndecrypt data. In the following sections, we will cover encryption algorithms\nin more detail.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Symmetric Encryption\n\u2022 Advanced Encryption Standard\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
